    "summary": "Propose reuse of accepted assertions A1–A10 for exact source 16ddc5b2e5054cc2474ba532325e5c9b5d224c01. Every accepted CLI, public HTTP, administrator-auth, console and metrics boundary was exercised against the canonical local build and retains its stated behavior; there are no exact requires identities. Shared catalog and key-policy behavior, response-phase conversion, explicit ingress validation, and the provider-probe timestamp correction change implementations but not those ten propositions. This review records fixture-only evidence and does not certify live provider entitlement, the unfinished full Gateway race check, or an unstamped image as a published release. Exact review confirmation by an authorized operator remains required."
